<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  A TEST feed, read only by a debug build with Pretend Update switched on.
  Production is appcast.xml. Delete this and Belay-test.dmg once in-app updating
  has shipped and been seen working on a real release.

  The payload has to be a build from current sources. v1.1.0 cannot be used:
  Sparkle refuses an update whose bundle has no SUPublicEDKey when the running
  one has, and says so plainly ("Sparkle only supports rotation, but not removal
  of (Ed)DSA keys"). It is right to refuse, and 1.1.0 shipped before the key
  existed, so there is nothing to fix on this end.
-->
