        <h2>One click updater</h2>
        <p>Update Now fetches the new version itself. No web page, no hunting.</p>
        <h2>Watch any folder</h2>
        <p>Point Belay at a folder your own tool writes to. It remembers the ones you pick.</p>
        <h2>A mark that says paused</h2>
        <p>When Belay lets go on purpose, the menu bar shows it.</p>
        <h2>What's New, after every update</h2>
        <p>Belay now opens with what changed. Once, then never again.</p>
